  "explanation": "dict.fromkeys(keys, []) attaches the SAME empty-list object as the value for every key. Appending to boxes['clients'] mutates that shared list, so every bucket — including 'staff' — ends up showing ['ada', 'lin', 'tal'] instead of its own empty list.",
